  // CO-00 (21 Aug 2026) — build-prompt v1.0 §4.2/§4.3, verbatim, sourced
  // from draft v2.0. H2 67, P1 383, P2 485 (rendered total 868 across
  // exactly two paragraphs), plus a third paragraph carrying the closing
